Manual model imports whose config references remote assets (download_files,
URI-valued model/mmproj) go through the gallery job queue - job UUID +
/models/jobs/{uuid} progress, same as gallery installs and URI imports -
instead of downloading synchronously inside the /models/import request.
Config-only imports keep the synchronous path. Proposed upstream.

